    "data": "<h1>Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"></figure><h1>排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: https://aquarite.uk</p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"></figure><h1>第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1PEKPzEEH3/\">等待着你</a></h1><h1></h1><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/2ac02a5928c49f48eb3573af1962e2443546800279522160.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1><strong></strong><br></h1><h1>第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13e7PztEGd/\" target=\"_blank\">回复还没好吗？大叔式发言！</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9c364ebd891fd2fc0eecc763d6b22d492e47506a.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vqQUYYEmg/\" target=\"_blank\">超级超级超级超级超级讨厌</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fd885be84d32fbfa4328a59cb40cb47034ec18e6.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Am3MzCEk9/\" target=\"_blank\">回忆</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b4659c5f12f51929a562623bef1e10c9ca2e3653.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LrGwzjE9J/\" target=\"_blank\">存在证明论</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8ad13fdc022286f932d1de6037f7743764c04d62.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1r43tzZEpZ/\" target=\"_blank\">停服啦</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1f28aa0245eb0802ceea22711872224ab2af6a88.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oC411572T/\" target=\"_blank\">死别</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cdf83836a76bddc46c63cfeff8e745755a5882de.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1K8KUzUEdX/\" target=\"_blank\">克隆克隆</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4ac72e591b13acea2cd09b9f8037fcd736f11ce9.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 12 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xAVezxEkw/\" target=\"_blank\">怪物之歌</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ef1239179dbcf92fea88bb21c606182afbb2a3a8.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 11 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YfJJzVEDF/\" target=\"_blank\">武装乙女</a></h1><